                                "sense_id": "8866be26-c42d-35fd-80f9-d60154af3781",
                                "text": "From an old record it appears that Charles I. of England granted numerous monopolies for obtainment of money for his purposes, independently of the Parliamentary grants, among others the manufacture of paper."
